# Patterns

Follow `docs/patterns.md`. Do not invent a parallel stack.

- Layers: route → factory → controller → service → repository. No `src/Feature/` folders. No SQL in controllers. No `$_POST` in services.
- Wire new classes in `src/bootstrap/installed_services.php` + `controller_factories.php`. Never `new Repository()` in a controller.
- Return `Response::*`. User copy via `$this->t()` / `{{ t() }}`. Exception message = i18n key.
- POST: `FormInput` + `assertCsrf()` (or `runMassActions()`). Admin writes also ACL + audit (`docs/acl.md`).
- SQL: prepared `?` only; `reveal()` before data leaves a repository.
- Twig: no `|raw` on data. Admin lists use `grid.twig`.
- After behavior change: update `docs/map.md` + the feature doc; add/adjust a unit test (`docs/testing.md`).
